{"step_index":275,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:05:13Z","thinking":"**Verifying theorem's correctness**\n\nThe `radius_le_eccentricity` theorem has been proven successfully. The proof has been checked and received a clean result code (RC 0). A look at the generated proof confirms this.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport subprocess, os, tempfile\n\ndef check_lean(code):\n    envf = '/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/.agf_env'\n    with open(envf) as f:\n        for line in f:\n            if line.startswith('AGF_ELAN_HOME='):\n                elan_home = line.strip().split('=', 1)[1]\n    lean = os.path.join(elan_home, 'bin/lean')\n    with open('/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/.agf_lean_path') as f:\n        lp = f.read().strip()\n    env = os.environ.copy()\n    env['ELAN_HOME'] = elan_home\n    env['LEAN_PATH'] = lp\n    with tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile(suffix='.lean', mode='w', delete=False) as tf:\n        tf.write(code)\n        tf_path = tf.name\n    res = subprocess.run([lean, tf_path], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env)\n    os.unlink(tf_path)\n    return res.stdout, res.stderr, res.returncode\n\ncode = '''\nimport Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nopen SimpleGraph\n\ntheorem exists_rdf_weight {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] :\n    ∃ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f ∧\n      GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G = GraphCalc.romanWeight f := by\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber\n  let f2 : V → Fin 3 := fun _ => 2\n  have hf2 : GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f2 := by\n    intro v hv\n    revert hv\n    decide\n  have hmem1 : f2 ∈ Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G) := by\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_univ f2, hf2⟩\n  have hmem2 : GraphCalc.romanWeight f2 ∈\n      (Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image GraphCalc.romanWeight :=\n    Finset.mem_image_of_mem GraphCalc.romanWeight hmem1\n  obtain ⟨m, hm⟩ := Finset.min_of_mem hmem2\n  rw [hm]\n  dsimp [Option.getD]\n  have hmin_mem := Finset.mem_of_min hm\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hmin_mem\n  obtain ⟨f, hf_filt, hf_wt⟩ := hmin_mem\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hf_filt\n  exact ⟨f, hf_filt.2, hf_wt.symm⟩\n'''\nout, err, rc = check_lean(code)\nprint('stdout:\\n', out)\nprint('stderr:\\n', err)\nprint('rc:', rc)\n\"","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","WaitMsBeforeAsync":30000,"toolAction":"Running command","toolSummary":"Test exists_rdf_weight lemma"}}]}
